This series introduce virtio-net features VIRTIO_NET_F_RSC_EXT,
VIRTIO_NET_F_RSS and VIRTIO_NET_F_HASH_REPORT.

Changes from v1:
__virtio -> __le
maximal -> maximum
minor style fixes

Yuri Benditovich (3):
  virtio-net: Introduce extended RSC feature
